hello there anime fans i hope you're  counting your fingers to the release  date of the fourth season  of everyone's favorite man vs monster  show so while we're waiting let's back  things up a little and take some history  lessons now shall we but don't worry  these aren't your regular history  lessons these are the info dumps that  made your jaw drop and think  honestly titans are the last thing i  should be worried about in this world to  keep things fair for my anime viewers i  won't be including any manga spoilers in  this video but do keep in mind this  video has spoilers for all  three seasons also don't forget to  subscribe to our channel to see  more awesome content like this since  there are a lot more top 10 anime  content coming your way with that said  here are 10 attack on titan plot reveals  that you never saw coming at number 10  we have aaron's titan revelation  at the end of the first arc things were  desperate not only for the new recruits  but the main trio as well erin was eaten  armin was psychologically fallen down  and mikasa was at the edge of giving up  and along comes a muscular force that  starts knocking off titans with his  punches this new titan seems to be the  soldier's ally  and possibly a force to be reckoned with  moments later it's revealed that inside  the nape of this beast  was aaron now this may be a surprise for  mukasa and all others but let's admit it  we saw this coming now didn't we i know  attack on titan got popular for killing  off characters and was dubbed as the  anime game of thrones but surely it  wouldn't be bold enough to kill off the  main character  even if he wasn't the best main  character have at that moment but  the twist showed that there were indeed  people who can transform into titans and  humanity had their own weapon to fight  off the threat of these giant beasts  next up at number nine we have the  revelation of the titans hiding inside  the walls  attack on titan's popular for two words  it's freedom  and the walls the two words aren't only  thematically related the latter is also  what protects the people from the titans  you can see the irony comes in here  in the very first episode of the second  season the face of a titan is shown  inside the walls this puts both the  survey corpse and the general populace  in panic was the thing that they feared  the most  actually what protected them at the same  time this is the first time  attack on titan poked a clue at us about  its law and showed the world has more  than what meets the eye  at least let's hope someone won't awaken  those colossal titans in the walls eh  coming in at number eight we have yemi's  transformation to a titan  what's with everyone transforming to a  titan when things turned desperate  first it was aaron then it was yamir and  then soon there's another duo in the  case of ymir she decides to pull the  blade and transform when the tower's  just about to collapse there were a lot  more candidates for titan  transformations and it was a surprise to  see yami being one she was always a  character who blended into the  background nicely and didn't get that  much attention but  it is attack on titan and even side  characters have a role to play in the  turn of events  ymir's titan came off as a surprise as  well while the previous titans were much  larger  yemi's titan seemed smaller and her size  seemed to be the exact thing that played  for her advantage  at number seven we've got the revelation  of the fake king  sometimes the show isn't all about  attacking titans the first court of  season three gave us a nice political  backstory mixed with some new characters  like kenny the ripper and rod reese it  also had some revelations in store for  us from royal families to character  pasts to political deceiving one thing  that belongs to the latter category is  the reveal that the white head old man  is just a puppet placed on the throne he  may have had an intriguing look of an  old king  but in truth it was rod reese who was  manipulating everyone in the background  of course the credit for the revelation  and the crude attack should go to the  one and only irwin smith because this  man managed to open the eyes of the  military once again  coming in at number six we've got the  revelation of annie leonhardt being the  female titan  in the middle of the second arc came the  threat of the female titan a titan more  athletically capable than other humans  and seemed to possess  intelligence similar to a normal human  after erwin's failed plans in the woods  all hopes seem to be lost then we're  directed to scenery inside the walls  where we're shown the daily life of a  depressed and anti-social annie  leonhardt  armin urges her to assist them to help  aaron escape and this  girl takes the bait surrounded by people  right at the top of the tunnel comes one  of the greatest revelations of attack on  titan  annie leonhardt was the cold and  ruthless female titan  well let me tell you this when the  apathetic girl suddenly gave unlike  yagami laugh and showed off her gamble  aaron wasn't the only one with the wide  eyes and surprised reaction  at number five we've got keith shaddis's  involvement with grisha jaeger  sometimes a bystander is more than a  bystander everyone was surprised when  keith mentioned aaron's mother back  during his training and the third season  shines the spotlight on this keith is  actually revealed to be a friend of  erin's father and it turns out grecia  wasn't the best friend someone should  have  keith explains the mysterious actions of  grisha after the fall of shiganshina and  finding eren in the forest this  explanation shines some light on the  scenes we saw in the second episode and  we begin to realize how aaron received  his titan form it also cast our  suspicions of grisha jaeger and we begin  to realize this man has a much bigger  role in the story  rather than just being the father of the  main character this is another example  of how even the minor characters of  attack on titan play a major role in the  events that happen and even though  characters might not realize it  themselves  they are more than just bystanders next  up we have the revelation of historia  who thought the cute girl that  alleviated everyone's stress would be  related to the royal family once again  the role of side characters comes into  play as we realize that crystal lens is  actually historia rhys a daughter born  to rodrice her past isn't the only thing  that's a surprise  along comes the revelation of a hideous  royal ceremony where children are  allowed to eat their predecessors to  gain the power of the mysterious  founding titan this is also where the  actions of eren's father comes into play  as we're shown how he forcefully took  the power of the founder  and passed it on to eren not the best  father then and then again rod can't  even be called a father to begin with  burdened by the fate of their parents  both aaron and historia are confused  about what to do  with the former urging historia to kill  him this revelation brought out the  theme of burden and for the first time  approached the history of the world in a  broader manner  coming in at number three we have the  first appearance of the female titan  now i know i already mentioned annie's  revelation but i'm sure the moment you  saw  a massive towering female standing up on  the isolated land beyond the wall gave  you the chills  up until that point we thought eren was  the only titan shifter  now imagine when a more athletic titan  comes and kills the soldiers one after  another leaving a trail of blood behind  either she was another titan shifter  like aaron  or anime's largest female psychopath  she also displays intelligence by  covering her nape when the survey corpse  fly behind her and then proceeds to take  them down in the most brutal way  possible credit should be given to the  directors and animators for portraying  this new threat in such a horrifying way  and showing us how dangerous the female  titan actually was the scenes that  preceded this were a mixture of  tension action and subtle creepiness  when the female titan lowered armin's  hood and gave that creepy smile i sure  thought that things were going to turn  upside down for levi and his gang  next at number two we have everyone's  favorite scene from attack on titan  the reveal of the armored and colossal  titan  after nearly three years this scene  still gives me the chills and it's no  wonder this was one of the biggest anime  reveals of all time  i watched with baited breath as the  so-called big brothers of the survey  corpse turned out to be the duo  that caused the destruction of  shiganshina five years ago it was like  the most climactic moment of a detective  anime where the culprits are revealed  and the conclusions about to come but  this time the climax happens with the  action and a bombastic sarwano  soundtrack and the conclusion is eren's  scream of rage  as he attacks the armored titan the  entire moment was like a perfectly  directed  four minutes jam-packed with revelation  and action and this scene managed to  prove the existence of multiple titan  shifters apart from just aaron yamir and  annie  reiner rarely broke down but when he did  he did it with a bang  topping our list we have the greatest  revelation of all time  the existence of people beyond the walls  [Music]  it's amazing how three diaries of a man  can turn your perspective  of 180. i'm not just speaking of life  beyond walls but  everything related to grecia's memories  including the war between  elder and mali the attack titan and even  minor revelations like the titan of dina  fritz  if attack on titan was a puzzle with  missing pieces this was what completed  it the man vs monster show  suddenly turned into a racist war  between men themselves the theme of  freedom no longer applied just to the  titans  but freedom from the wider world as well  it gave more depth to the story  expanded the world and even changed the  perspective of aaron and others it's  like you're trapped in a dark room and  given a torch to find the door  but after you open the door you find  yourself in a much larger and complex  mansion honestly i don't think even that  metaphor would be suitable for what  isayama has done to us  [Music]  so out of these 10 plot revelations  which one hit you the hardest we know  what hit eren the hardest and season  four  is gonna be proof of it speaking of  season four manga readers out there know  there's a lot in store for us that could  fill in another top 10 list so keep  counting down until december the 7th  that's it i hope you enjoyed the video  and don't forget to drop a like if you  did  that's it for today anime fans and i'll  see you in the next video  [Music]

